# Keep LF in every checkout, including Git for Windows with core.autocrlf=true.
# Migration 202611030004 compares an embedded function body byte-for-byte against pg_proc.prosrc
# (and scripts/check-rls.mjs pins its SHA-256); CRLF would make that migration fail on deploy.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
